                <h3>Inside 'Blue Shades', Vilpa Max's Visionary Animated Series</h3>
                <p class="dateAesteticTitle2">By Zafira Hafiz</p>

            </div>
            <div class="col s12 m3"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
